{% comment %}
    LIFE GROUP DETAILS — one group (route `next-steps/find-a-group/details`,
    ?GroupId=). Shown in the group finder's pop-up (LifeGroupSearch.lava; theme.js
    "Group pop-up" loads this page in an iframe) and on its own when linked
    directly.

    Page:                     Layout Blank (Layouts/Blank.aspx: theme CSS, font,
                              icons and theme.js, no header or footer)
    Block 1 (Main zone):      an HTML block
      Block content:          {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/LifeGroupDetails.lava' %}
      Enabled Lava Commands:  RockEntity  (the group, the campuses)
    Block 2 (Main zone):      Rock's Group Registration block, below it
      (theme.js finds it by Rock's own class, group-registration; to use a
      different block, give it the CSS Class group-signup)
      Its Lava template:      blank (this card already shows the group)
      Its CSS Class (optional): signup-no-home-phone and/or signup-no-address
                              hide those Full-mode fields, which the block
                              itself can't turn off (Styles/_group-detail.scss)

    THE CARD
      Front   a band in the kind of group's colour (as on the finder's cards)
              with the name and when it meets; the description; the facts
              (schedule, where, kind, content, childcare, drop in, leaders); a
              map; "Sign up for this group" and "Back to groups".
              A quiet share button (the design system's share menu, as on the
              event cards; theme.js "Share dropdowns") ends that row: Facebook,
              Email, Text message, Copy link, all with this page's own address
              (shareUrl: the group alone, its name as the page title).
      Back    the Group Registration block. theme.js ("Group details") moves the
              .group-signup block into the card's back, and "Sign up for this
              group" flips the card over to it. After the form posts back the
              card opens on its back again (the browser session remembers), so
              the result shows where the form was.
      Without JavaScript, or without the registration block, there's no flip:
      the block (if any) shows under the card.
      AlternateSignup (an address on the group): the sign-up button goes there
      instead (out of the pop-up; a new tab when it's off-site).
      Full (capacity set and reached): no sign-up, a note instead.

    PLACE AND MAP (Google Static Maps, the Global attribute GoogleAPIKey)
      At VRL (the campus location, a room in it, or 1831 S Barker): "At Valley
        Real Life", the room's name, a pin on the campus.
      ApproxGeo = Yes: the town only, and the map shows a shaded circle around
        the group's coordinates ROUNDED to two decimals (about 1 km), no pin, so
        neither the page nor the map's address carries the real location.
      Otherwise: the street address and a pin.
      No coordinates: no map; no location: "Ask the leader where it meets".
      The map opens Google Maps (the rounded point for approximate groups).

    Only active, public groups show (requirePublic below), as in the finder;
    anything else reads "We couldn't find that group".
    Styles: Styles/_group-detail.scss.
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%} ===== SETTINGS ===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign finderUrl = '/next-steps/find-a-group/search' -%}
{%- assign detailUrl = '/next-steps/find-a-group/details' -%}{%- comment -%} this page: the address the share menu passes on {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign requirePublic = true -%}
{%- assign colorByGroupType = true -%}{%- comment -%} keep the same as LifeGroupSearch.lava's {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mapZoom = 14 -%}
{%- assign approxZoom = 13 -%}

{%- assign groupId = 'Global' | PageParameter:'GroupId' | AsInteger -%}
{%- assign Group = null -%}
{%- if groupId and groupId > 0 -%}
  {%- group id:'{{ groupId }}' securityenabled:'false' -%}
    {%- assign Group = group -%}
  {%- endgroup -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if Group -%}
  {%- if Group.IsActive != true or Group.IsArchived == true %}{% assign Group = null %}{% endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if Group and requirePublic -%}
  {%- if Group.IsPublic != true %}{% assign Group = null %}{% endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if Group -%}

  {%- comment -%} Kind of group, and its colour (as in LifeGroupSearch.lava) {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign compLabels = 'mixed:Mixed|men:Men’s|women:Women’s|young-adult:Young adults' | Split:'|' -%}
  {%- assign compText = Group | Attribute:'GroupComp' | Trim -%}
  {%- assign compList = compText | Split:',' -%}
  {%- assign compKeys = ' ' -%}
  {%- assign kindText = '' -%}
  {%- for compItem in compList -%}
    {%- assign compName = compItem | Trim -%}
    {%- if compName != '' -%}
      {%- assign compKey = compName | Downcase | Replace:' ','-' -%}
      {%- assign compKeys = compKeys | Append:compKey | Append:' ' -%}
      {%- assign compLabel = compName -%}
      {%- for pair in compLabels -%}
        {%- assign pairKey = pair | Split:':' | First -%}
        {%- if pairKey == compKey %}{% assign compLabel = pair | Split:':' | Last %}{% endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- if kindText != '' %}{% assign kindText = kindText | Append:' · ' %}{% endif -%}
      {%- assign kindText = kindText | Append:compLabel -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign toneKey = '' -%}
  {%- if compKeys contains ' young-adult ' %}{% assign toneKey = 'young-adult' %}{% elsif compKeys contains ' men ' %}{% assign toneKey = 'men' %}{% elsif compKeys contains ' women ' %}{% assign toneKey = 'women' %}{% elsif compKeys contains ' mixed ' %}{% assign toneKey = 'mixed' %}{% endif -%}
  {%- if colorByGroupType == false %}{% assign toneKey = '' %}{% endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} When {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign schedText = Group.Schedule.FriendlyScheduleText | Default:'' | Trim -%}
  {%- if schedText contains '<' %}{% assign schedText = '' %}{% endif -%}
  {%- assign schedText = schedText | Replace:'Weekly: ','' -%}
  {%- assign daysText = Group | Attribute:'DaysOfWeek' | Trim -%}

  {%- comment -%} Content, childcare, drop in {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign topicText = Group | Attribute:'Topic' | Trim -%}
  {%- assign topicLower = topicText | Downcase -%}
  {%- assign childcareText = Group | Attribute:'HasChildcare' | Downcase | Trim -%}
  {%- assign dropInText = Group | Attribute:'IsDropInGroup' | Downcase | Trim -%}
  {%- assign isDropIn = false -%}
  {%- if dropInText == 'yes' or dropInText == 'true' %}{% assign isDropIn = true %}{% endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Full: capacity set and reached; leaders {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign capacity = Group.GroupCapacity | Default:0 | AsInteger -%}
  {%- assign activeMembers = 0 -%}
  {%- assign leaderNames = '' | Split:'' -%}
  {%- assign leaderLasts = '' | Split:'' -%}
  {%- for member in Group.Members -%}
    {%- capture memberStatus %}{{ member.GroupMemberStatus }}{% endcapture -%}
    {%- if memberStatus == 'Active' -%}
      {%- assign activeMembers = activeMembers | Plus:1 -%}
      {%- if member.GroupRole.IsLeader -%}
        {%- assign leaderNames = leaderNames | AddToArray:member.Person.NickName -%}
        {%- assign leaderLasts = leaderLasts | AddToArray:member.Person.LastName -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign isFull = false -%}
  {%- if capacity > 0 and activeMembers >= capacity %}{% assign isFull = true %}{% endif -%}
  {%- comment -%} Leaders: "Jon & Amy Pierce" for a couple, otherwise full names {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign leadersText = '' -%}
  {%- assign leaderCount = leaderNames | Size -%}
  {%- if leaderCount == 2 and leaderLasts[0] == leaderLasts[1] -%}
    {%- assign leadersText = leaderNames[0] | Append:' & ' | Append:leaderNames[1] | Append:' ' | Append:leaderLasts[0] -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- for leaderName in leaderNames -%}
      {%- if forloop.first == false %}{% if forloop.last %}{% assign leadersText = leadersText | Append:' & ' %}{% else %}{% assign leadersText = leadersText | Append:', ' %}{% endif %}{% endif -%}
      {%- assign leadersText = leadersText | Append:leaderName | Append:' ' | Append:leaderLasts[forloop.index0] -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Place {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign campusLocationIds = ',' -%}
  {%- campus where:'IsActive == true' securityenabled:'false' -%}
    {%- for campusItem in campusItems -%}
      {%- if campusItem.LocationId %}{% assign campusLocationIds = campusLocationIds | Append:campusItem.LocationId | Append:',' %}{% endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcampus -%}
  {%- assign groupLocation = null -%}
  {%- for gl in Group.GroupLocations -%}
    {%- if gl.Location %}{% assign groupLocation = gl.Location %}{% break %}{% endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign approxText = Group | Attribute:'ApproxGeo' | Downcase | Trim -%}
  {%- assign isApprox = false -%}
  {%- if approxText == 'yes' or approxText == 'true' %}{% assign isApprox = true %}{% endif -%}
  {%- assign onCampus = false -%}
  {%- assign placeText = '' -%}
  {%- assign placeNote = '' -%}
  {%- assign mapPoint = '' -%}
  {%- assign mapQuery = '' -%}
  {%- if groupLocation -%}
    {%- assign street = groupLocation.Street1 | Default:'' | Trim -%}
    {%- assign streetLower = street | Downcase -%}
    {%- assign cityName = groupLocation.City | Default:'' | Trim -%}
    {%- assign locationName = groupLocation.Name | Default:'' | Trim -%}
    {%- assign locationNameLower = locationName | Downcase -%}
    {%- assign locationKey = ',' | Append:groupLocation.Id | Append:',' -%}
    {%- assign parentKey = ',' | Append:groupLocation.ParentLocationId | Append:',' -%}
    {%- if streetLower contains '1831' and streetLower contains 'barker' %}{% assign onCampus = true %}{% endif -%}
    {%- if locationNameLower contains 'barker' %}{% assign onCampus = true %}{% endif -%}
    {%- if campusLocationIds contains locationKey or campusLocationIds contains parentKey %}{% assign onCampus = true %}{% endif -%}
    {%- if onCampus -%}
      {%- assign isApprox = false -%}
      {%- assign placeText = 'At Valley Real Life' -%}
      {%- comment -%} a room's name (not the campus's own) {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign placeNote = locationName -%}
      {%- if locationNameLower contains 'barker' or locationNameLower contains 'valley real life' %}{% assign placeNote = '' %}{% endif -%}
      {%- if street != '' %}{% assign mapQuery = street | Append:', ' | Append:cityName %}{% else %}{% assign mapQuery = '1831 S Barker Rd, Greenacres, WA' %}{% endif -%}
    {%- elsif isApprox -%}
      {%- if cityName != '' %}{% assign placeText = 'Near ' | Append:cityName %}{% else %}{% assign placeText = 'A home nearby' %}{% endif -%}
      {%- assign placeNote = 'The leader shares the address when you sign up.' -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- assign placeText = street -%}
      {%- if cityName != '' %}{% if placeText != '' %}{% assign placeText = placeText | Append:', ' %}{% endif %}{% assign placeText = placeText | Append:cityName %}{% endif -%}
      {%- if locationName != '' and placeText == '' %}{% assign placeText = locationName %}{% endif -%}
      {%- assign mapQuery = placeText -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if groupLocation.Latitude -%}
      {%- if isApprox -%}
        {%- assign lat = groupLocation.Latitude | Format:'0.00' -%}
        {%- assign lng = groupLocation.Longitude | Format:'0.00' -%}
        {%- assign mapQuery = lat | Append:',' | Append:lng -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- assign lat = groupLocation.Latitude | Format:'0.00000' -%}
        {%- assign lng = groupLocation.Longitude | Format:'0.00000' -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- assign mapPoint = lat | Append:',' | Append:lng -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if placeText == '' %}{% assign placeText = 'Ask the leader where it meets' %}{% assign mapPoint = '' %}{% endif -%}
  {%- assign mapKey = 'Global' | Attribute:'GoogleAPIKey' | Trim -%}
  {%- if mapKey == '' %}{% assign mapPoint = '' %}{% endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Sign up somewhere else {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign altSignup = Group | Attribute:'AlternateSignup','RawValue' | Trim -%}
  {%- assign altExternal = false -%}
  {%- if altSignup != '' -%}
    {%- assign altStart = altSignup | Slice:0,4 | Downcase -%}
    {%- if altStart == 'http' %}{% unless altSignup contains 'vrl.church' %}{% assign altExternal = true %}{% endunless %}{% endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- capture pageTitleSet %}{{ Group.Name | SetPageTitle }}{% endcapture -%}

<article class="group-detail" data-group-detail="{{ Group.Id }}"{% if toneKey != '' %} data-tone="{{ toneKey }}"{% endif %} itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
  <meta itemprop="headline" content="{{ Group.Name | Escape }}">
  <div class="group-detail__card" data-gd-card>

    <!-- ===== FRONT: the group ===== -->
    <section class="group-detail__face" data-gd-front aria-labelledby="gd-name">
      <header class="group-detail__band">
        <p class="group-detail__kicker">{% if kindText != '' %}{{ kindText }} {% endif %}Life Group</p>
        <h1 class="group-detail__name" id="gd-name">{{ Group.Name }}</h1>
        {%- if schedText != '' %}
        <p class="group-detail__when">{{ schedText }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- if isDropIn %}
        <span class="group-detail__sticker">Drop in</span>
        {%- endif %}
      </header>

      <div class="group-detail__body" itemprop="articleBody">
        {%- assign description = Group.Description | Trim -%}
        {%- if description != '' %}
        <div class="group-detail__desc">{{ description | Escape | NewlineToBr }}</div>
        {%- endif %}

        <ul class="group-detail__facts">
          {%- if schedText != '' or daysText != '' %}
          <li><span class="group-detail__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></span><span><strong>When</strong>{% if schedText != '' %}{{ schedText }}{% else %}{{ daysText }}{% endif %}</span></li>
          {%- endif %}
          <li><span class="group-detail__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20"><use href="#i-map-pin"/></svg></span><span><strong>Where</strong>{{ placeText }}{% if placeNote != '' %}<small>{{ placeNote }}</small>{% endif %}</span></li>
          {%- if kindText != '' %}
          <li><span class="group-detail__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20"><use href="#i-users"/></svg></span><span><strong>Who</strong>{{ kindText }}</span></li>
          {%- endif %}
          {%- if topicText != '' and topicLower != 'other' %}
          <li><span class="group-detail__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20"><use href="#i-book"/></svg></span><span><strong>What we study</strong>{% if topicLower contains 'sermon series' %}We follow along with the weekend message{% else %}{{ topicText }}{% endif %}</span></li>
          {%- endif %}
          {%- if childcareText == 'yes' or childcareText contains 'ask' %}
          <li><span class="group-detail__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20"><use href="#i-kid"/></svg></span><span><strong>Childcare</strong>{% if childcareText == 'yes' %}Available{% else %}Ask the leader about childcare{% endif %}</span></li>
          {%- endif %}
          {%- if isDropIn %}
          <li><span class="group-detail__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg></span><span><strong>Drop in</strong>Come any week, no sign-up needed</span></li>
          {%- endif %}
          {%- if leadersText != '' %}
          <li><span class="group-detail__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20"><use href="#i-user-circle"/></svg></span><span><strong>{% if leaderCount > 1 %}Leaders{% else %}Leader{% endif %}</strong>{{ leadersText }}</span></li>
          {%- endif %}
        </ul>

        {%- if mapPoint != '' %}
        {%- capture mapSrc %}https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/staticmap?center={{ mapPoint }}&zoom={% if isApprox %}{{ approxZoom }}{% else %}{{ mapZoom }}{% endif %}&size=640x280&scale=2&maptype=roadmap&style=feature:poi%7Cvisibility:off&style=feature:transit%7Cvisibility:off{% unless isApprox %}&markers=color:0x9bc93c%7C{{ mapPoint }}{% endunless %}&key={{ mapKey }}{% endcapture %}
        <a class="group-detail__map{% if isApprox %} group-detail__map--approx{% endif %}" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query={{ mapQuery | UrlEncode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <img src="{{ mapSrc | Trim }}" width="640" height="280" alt="{% if isApprox %}Map of the area near where {{ Group.Name | Escape }} meets{% else %}Map of where {{ Group.Name | Escape }} meets{% endif %}" loading="lazy">
          <span class="group-detail__map-label">{% if isApprox %}Meets in this area{% else %}Open in Google Maps{% endif %} <svg width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"/></svg></span>
        </a>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>

      <footer class="group-detail__actions">
        {%- if isFull %}
        <p class="group-detail__full">This group is full right now. Check back soon, or find another group that fits.</p>
        {%- elsif altSignup != '' %}
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ altSignup | Escape }}"{% if altExternal %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% else %} target="_top"{% endif %}>Sign up for this group</a>
        {%- else %}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-gd-flip hidden>Sign up for this group</button>
        {%- endif %}
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="{{ finderUrl }}" target="_top" data-gd-close>Back to groups</a>
        {%- capture shareUrl %}{{ 'Global' | Page:'Scheme' }}://{{ 'Global' | Page:'Host' }}{{ detailUrl }}?GroupId={{ Group.Id }}{% endcapture %}
        {%- capture shareText %}{{ Group.Name }} · a Life Group at Valley Real Life{% endcapture %}
        <div class="share group-detail__share">
          <button class="share__btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="gd-share" aria-label="Share this group" data-share-toggle>
            <svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-share"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="share__menu" id="gd-share" data-open="false">
            <a class="share__item" href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u={{ shareUrl | EscapeDataString }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-facebook"/></svg> Facebook</a>
            <a class="share__item" href="mailto:?subject={{ shareText | EscapeDataString }}&amp;body={{ shareUrl | EscapeDataString }}" target="_top"><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-mail"/></svg> Email</a>
            <a class="share__item" href="sms:?&amp;body={{ shareText | Append:' ' | Append:shareUrl | EscapeDataString }}" target="_top"><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-message"/></svg> Text message</a>
            <div class="share__divider"></div>
            <button class="share__item" type="button" data-copy="{{ shareUrl }}"><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-copy"/></svg> <span>Copy link</span></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== BACK: sign up (theme.js moves the .group-signup block in here) ===== -->
    <section class="group-detail__face group-detail__face--back" data-gd-back aria-labelledby="gd-signup" hidden>
      <header class="group-detail__band group-detail__band--slim">
        <button type="button" class="group-detail__back" data-gd-unflip><svg width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-left"/></svg> Back to the group</button>
        <p class="group-detail__kicker">Sign up</p>
        <h2 class="group-detail__name" id="gd-signup" tabindex="-1">{{ Group.Name }}</h2>
        {%- if schedText != '' %}
        <p class="group-detail__when">{{ schedText }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
      </header>
      <div class="group-detail__form" data-gd-slot></div>
    </section>

  </div>
</article>

{%- else -%}

<article class="group-detail group-detail--missing">
  <div class="group-detail__card">
    <section class="group-detail__face">
      <header class="group-detail__band">
        <p class="group-detail__kicker">Life Groups</p>
        <h1 class="group-detail__name">We couldn't find that group</h1>
      </header>
      <div class="group-detail__body">
        <p>It may have finished or stopped taking new people. There are plenty of others to choose from.</p>
      </div>
      <footer class="group-detail__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ finderUrl }}" target="_top" data-gd-close>Find a group</a>
      </footer>
    </section>
  </div>
</article>

{%- endif -%}
